      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCE NASEEM NZ (7) is a two-year-old gelding by Tiger Tara on debut for Chantal Turpin. Must overcome a very wide draw but he has been showing ability at the trials. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to his career. EXIT ELEVEN (2) resumes from a spell of four months after closing off a short maiden campaign with a solid second here. Readied with two trials, winning the latest, and has the benefit of a good draw. CHARMED CONQUEST (4) was far from disgraced when fifth from the back row in the Triad Final and was an easy winner here prior. YIPPEE KIYAY (6) is another coming back off the Triad Final and was a fresh winner here prior. Draws wide but strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance.",
